@startuml E41-pin-request
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title E41 — Request ConformsTo pin\ncatalog:pin:request (Author) — ARCH / FIX-ALLOW-PIN-REQUEST

C4Seq_User()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_RouteGuard()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqUser, seqOTEL
  Author **requests** only — does not apply the live
  ConformsTo pin (FIX-DENY-AUTHOR-PIN-APPLY).
  Apply/deny = **E41a** via conforms_to_applicator slot.
end note

== Request pin ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : Request ConformsTo\n(imprint_id, item_uid)
RbacRouteGuard("catalog:pin:request")
ClientScopedQuery("POST", "/clients/{clientId}/conformance-pin-requests")
ControlNote(seqAPI, "SC-8, AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Creates pending conformance_pin_request")

seqAPI -> seqBusiness : requestPin(actor, version_uid, imprint_id, item_uid)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Northline: pin is (catalog_imprint_id, item_uid); no copied control text")

RbacCheck("catalog:pin:request")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Author may request; apply requires applicator slot")

HookEval("catalog:pin:request")
ControlNote(seqData, "CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "hook-pin-request: gates_before=[] ; effects write_conformance_pin_request")

' empty gates_before — still show HookEval pattern
note right of seqBusiness
  No gates_before on request path;
  applicator GateCheck is on E41a apply/deny.
end note

seqBusiness -> seqData : insert conformance_pin_request(status=pending)
seqData -> seqPostgres : INSERT conformance_pin_request
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "AC-3, AU-2", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Pending request SoT awaiting applicator")
seqPostgres --> seqData : row
seqData --> seqBusiness : request

HookEffectsAfter("write_conformance_pin_request, audit")
AuditLog("catalog.pin.request", "version_uid imprint item")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Auditable Author pin request")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : request DTO
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : 201 Created
seqWebUI --> seqUser : pending — awaits Security/Steward

@enduml
